# Copy this file to ".env" in the same folder and fill in your key.
# Needed for the "Teraaskebari Reporting" AI person-counting feature.
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: only needed if you want AI analysis to work on VIDEO reports
# too (a still frame is grabbed from the video with ffmpeg before it's
# sent to the AI). Install ffmpeg on the server and make sure it's on
# PATH. Photo reports work without ffmpeg.
